# VEX Attribute Access Patterns

## Built-in Attributes

### Point Attributes (most common)
| Attribute | Type | Description | Default |
|-----------|------|-------------|---------|
| `@P` | vector | Position | {0,0,0} |
| `@N` | vector | Normal | {0,0,0} |
| `@Cd` | vector | Color (RGB 0-1) | {1,1,1} |
| `@Alpha` | float | Opacity | 1.0 |
| `@v` | vector | Velocity | {0,0,0} |
| `@pscale` | float | Point scale | 1.0 |
| `@orient` | vector4 | Orientation quaternion | {0,0,0,1} |
| `@up` | vector | Up vector (with @N for frame) | {0,1,0} |
| `@id` | int | Persistent ID (survives topology changes) | -1 |
| `@age` | float | Particle age (seconds) | 0.0 |
| `@life` | float | Particle lifespan (seconds) | -1 |
| `@rest` | vector | Rest position (for noise stability) | @P at creation |
| `@width` | float | Curve/line width | 0.0 |
| `@uv` | vector | UV coordinates | {0,0,0} |

### Point Context Variables
| Variable | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `@ptnum` | int | Current point index (0-based) |
| `@numpt` | int | Total number of points |
| `@primnum` | int | Current primitive index (prim/vtx run-over) |
| `@numprim` | int | Total number of primitives |
| `@vtxnum` | int | Current linear vertex index |
| `@numvtx` | int | Total number of vertices |
| `@elemnum` | int | Current element (generic, any run-over) |
| `@numelem` | int | Total elements (generic) |

### Global Variables
| Variable | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `@Time` | float | Current time in seconds |
| `@Frame` | float | Current frame number |
| `@TimeInc` | float | Time step between frames |
| `@OpInput1` | string | Path to first input node |
| `@OpInput2` | string | Path to second input node |

## Reading Attributes

### @-Shorthand (current element)
```vex
// Read from current point (fastest)
vector pos = @P;
float scale = @pscale;
int myint = i@myattr;
string name = s@name;
```

### Function Syntax (any element, any input)
```vex
// Read point attribute from input 0, point 5
vector pos = point(0, "P", 5);
float val = point(0, "density", @ptnum);

// Read from input 1
vector target = point(1, "P", @ptnum);

// Read primitive attribute
string name = prim(0, "name", @primnum);
float area = prim(0, "measuredarea", 0);

// Read vertex attribute
vector uv = vertex(0, "uv", @vtxnum);

// Read detail (global) attribute
int count = detail(0, "numitems");
string path = detail(1, "filepath");
```

### Array Attributes
```vex
// Read array attribute
int ids[] = point(0, "connected_ids", @ptnum);
float weights[] = point(0, "captureweights", @ptnum);

// Using @-shorthand for arrays
int myarr[] = i[]@myarray;
```

## Writing Attributes

### @-Shorthand (creates if doesn't exist)
```vex
// Write to current point
@P = {0, 1, 0};                    // Set position
@Cd = {1, 0, 0};                   // Set color to red
f@density = 1.5;                   // Create/set float
v@myvel = set(1, 0, 0);           // Create/set vector
i@class = floor(rand(@ptnum) * 5); // Create/set int
s@name = sprintf("pt_%d", @ptnum); // Create/set string
```

### Function Syntax (any element)
```vex
// Set attribute on specific point
setpointattrib(0, "Cd", ptnum, {1,0,0}, "set");
setpointattrib(0, "density", ptnum, 1.5, "set");

// Set primitive attribute
setprimattrib(0, "name", primnum, "group_a", "set");

// Set detail attribute (global)
setdetailattrib(0, "total_area", area, "set");

// Mode argument: "set", "add", "min", "max", "mult"
setpointattrib(0, "density", pt, 0.1, "add");  // Accumulate
```

## Groups

```vex
// Add current point to group
i@group_selected = 1;

// Remove from group
i@group_selected = 0;

// Check group membership
if (inpointgroup(0, "mygroup", @ptnum)) {
    // Point is in group
}

// Check prim group
if (inprimgroup(0, "walls", @primnum)) {
    // Prim is in group
}

// Set group from condition
i@group_large = (@pscale > 0.5) ? 1 : 0;
```

## Intrinsic Attributes

Intrinsic attributes are computed on-the-fly and not stored as regular attributes.

```vex
// Read intrinsic (use primintrinsic / pointintrinsic)
float area = primintrinsic(0, "measuredarea", @primnum);
vector bounds = primintrinsic(0, "bounds", @primnum);
string type = primintrinsic(0, "typename", @primnum);
int closed = primintrinsic(0, "closed", @primnum);

// Useful intrinsics
// Prim: measuredarea, measuredperimeter, bounds, typename, closed
// Detail: bounds, pointcount, primitivecount
```

## Attribute Promotion Patterns

```vex
// Point to detail (sum all point values) -- run over Detail
float total = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < npoints(0); i++) {
    total += point(0, "area", i);
}
f@total_area = total;

// Detail to point (broadcast) -- run over Points
f@threshold = detail(0, "threshold");

// Prim to point (average over connected prims) -- run over Points
int prims[] = pointprims(0, @ptnum);
vector avg_cd = {0,0,0};
foreach (int pr; prims) {
    avg_cd += prim(0, "Cd", pr);
}
@Cd = avg_cd / max(len(prims), 1);
```

## Common Patterns

### Nearest-Point Transfer
```vex
// Transfer attribute from input 1's nearest point
int near = nearpoint(1, @P);
if (near >= 0) {
    @Cd = point(1, "Cd", near);
}
```

### Distance-Weighted Blend
```vex
// Blend attribute from multiple nearby points on input 1
int pts[] = pcfind(1, "P", @P, chf("radius"), chi("maxpts"));
vector total_cd = {0,0,0};
float total_w = 0;
foreach (int pt; pts) {
    float d = distance(@P, point(1, "P", pt));
    float w = 1.0 / max(d, 0.001);
    total_cd += point(1, "Cd", pt) * w;
    total_w += w;
}
if (total_w > 0) @Cd = total_cd / total_w;
```

